 wk/view)\n\n**💰 ON-THE-SPOT REGISTRATION**\n**₹299 per person**\n**
 ₹249 per person** **for groups of** **3+ friends**\n\n**❓ FAQ's:**\n**
 “I haven't watched The Traitors. Can I still come?”**\n**Of course. Yo
 u don't need to know the show at all.**\n\n“I've never played social ded
 uction before.”\nPerfect. We'll teach you.\n\n“I'm coming alone.”\nT
 otally fine. We'll help you get into a game.\n\n**“I'm shy / introverted
 .”**\n**You don't have to be the loudest person in the room. Watch\, lis
